{
  "name": "MiniMax H3",
  "description": "Workflow for MiniMax H3 video to video (the source video as a reference) with native stereo sound",
  "defaults": {
    "steps": 20,
    "sampler_name": "res_multistep",
    "scheduler": "simple",
    "megapixels": 0.4
  },
  "groups": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Model Loaders",
      "member_nodes": ["10", "11", "12", "13", "note:1"]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "Reference Video",
      "member_nodes": ["2", "4", "6", "7", "note:2"]
    }
  ],
  "notes": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Model Selection",
      "content": "### Recommended Models\n\n- **Diffusion model:** **MiniMax H3 REF2VA** (reference to video, Int8)\n- **Text encoder:** **Qwen3-VL 32B** for MiniMax H3 (NVFP4 AWQ)\n- **VAE:** the MiniMax H3 **video** VAE\n- **Audio VAE:** the MiniMax H3 **audio** VAE\n\n---\n\n*MiniMax H3 generates the picture and its stereo sound together, at 24 fps.*"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Reference Video",
      "content": "### How It Works\n\nThe source video (its first 15 seconds, with its sound) is a **reference**: the result follows its content, motion and camera, but isn't converted frame by frame.\n\n- Refer to it in the prompt as **<Video 1>**, e.g. *The same scene as <Video 1>, restyled as a watercolor painting.*\n- The result is as long as the source and keeps its aspect ratio.\n- **Megapixels:** 0.4 for speed, up to ~1.0 (768p)\n\n---\n\n*Sources at 24 fps work best: other frame rates are read as 24 fps. Sources shorter than 2 seconds aren't supported.*"
    }
  ],
  "nodes": {
    "1": {
      "class_type": "LoadVideo",
      "inputs": {
        "file": "{{video_filename}}"
      },
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Source Video"
      }
    },
    "2": {
      "class_type": "Video Slice",
      "inputs": {
        "video": ["1", 0],
        "start_time": 0.0,
        "duration": 15.0,
        "strict_duration": false
      },
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Up to 15 Seconds"
      }
    },
    "3": {
      "class_type": "GetVideoComponents",
      "inputs": {
        "video": ["2", 0]
      },
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Get Video Components"
      }
    },
    "4": {
      "class_type": "ImageScaleToTotalPixels",
      "inputs": {
        "image": ["3", 0],
        "upscale_method": "lanczos",
        "megapixels": "{{megapixels}}",
        "resolution_steps": 32
      },
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Scale to Megapixels"
      }
    },
    "5": {
      "class_type": "GetImageSize",
      "inputs": {
        "image": ["4", 0]
      },
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Video Size"
      }
    },
    "6": {
      "class_type": "ComfyMathExpression",
      "inputs": {
        "expression": "max(5, round(a / b * 24)) + (5 - (max(5, round(a / b * 24)) % 17)) % 17",
        "values.a": ["5", 2],
        "values.b": ["3", 2]
      },
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Source Length at 24 fps"
      }
    },
    "7": {
      "class_type": "MiniMaxH3ReferenceToVideo",
      "inputs": {
        "clip": ["11", 0],
        "vae": ["12", 0],
        "audio_vae": ["13", 0],
        "prompt": "{{positive_prompt}}",
        "width": ["5", 0],
        "height": ["5", 1],
        "length": ["6", 1],
        "ref_image_size": "match",
        "ref_videos.ref_video_0": ["4", 0],
        "ref_video_audios.ref_video_audio_0": ["3", 1]
      },
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Reference to Video"
      }
    },
    "10": {
      "class_type": "UNETLoader",
      "inputs": {
        "unet_name": "{{unet_name}}",
        "weight_dtype": "default"
      },
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Load Diffusion Model"
      }
    },
    "11": {
      "class_type": "CLIPLoader",
      "inputs": {
        "clip_name": "{{clip_name}}",
        "type": "minimax",
        "device": "default"
      },
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Load Text Encoder"
      }
    },
    "12": {
      "class_type": "VAELoader",
      "inputs": {
        "vae_name": "{{vae_name}}"
      },
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Load Video VAE"
      }
    },
    "13": {
      "class_type": "VAELoader",
      "inputs": {
        "vae_name": "{{audio_vae_name}}"
      },
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Load Audio VAE"
      }
    },
    "20": {
      "class_type": "RandomNoise",
      "inputs": {
        "noise_seed": "{{seed}}"
      },
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Noise"
      }
    },
    "21": {
      "class_type": "BasicGuider",
      "inputs": {
        "model": ["10", 0],
        "conditioning": ["7", 0]
      },
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Guider"
      }
    },
    "22": {
      "class_type": "KSamplerSelect",
      "inputs": {
        "sampler_name": "{{sampler_name}}"
      },
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Sampler"
      }
    },
    "23": {
      "class_type": "BasicScheduler",
      "inputs": {
        "model": ["10", 0],
        "scheduler": "{{scheduler}}",
        "steps": "{{steps}}",
        "denoise": 1.0
      },
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Scheduler"
      }
    },
    "24": {
      "class_type": "SamplerCustomAdvanced",
      "inputs": {
        "noise": ["20", 0],
        "guider": ["21", 0],
        "sampler": ["22", 0],
        "sigmas": ["23", 0],
        "latent_image": ["7", 1]
      },
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Sample"
      }
    },
    "25": {
      "class_type": "VAEDecode",
      "inputs": {
        "samples": ["24", 0],
        "vae": ["12", 0]
      },
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Decode Video"
      }
    },
    "26": {
      "class_type": "VAEDecodeAudio",
      "inputs": {
        "samples": ["24", 0],
        "vae": ["13", 0]
      },
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Decode Audio"
      }
    },
    "27": {
      "class_type": "CreateVideo",
      "inputs": {
        "images": ["25", 0],
        "audio": ["26", 0],
        "fps": 24
      },
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Create Video"
      }
    },
    "28": {
      "class_type": "SaveVideo",
      "inputs": {
        "filename_prefix": "video/ComfyChair",
        "format": "auto",
        "codec": "auto",
        "video": ["27", 0]
      },
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Save Video"
      }
    }
  }
}
